# ===== Large data files (pre-computed MR DB etc. - too big for git; remove this line to share) =====
*.duckdb
*.parquet

# ===== Proteome sweep output: keep the index + 4 sample dossiers in git; the other 987
# dossiers and the raw cache (~80 MB of JSON) stay local. Regenerate with proteome_sweep.py.
dossiers/*
!dossiers/master_index.csv
!dossiers/HMGCR_dossier.md
!dossiers/PNPLA3_dossier.md
!dossiers/IL6R_dossier.md
!dossiers/PCSK9_dossier.md

